## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-5.2 Pro
- **Short description:** OpenAI’s previous high-compute pro model for complex professional work and multi-step reasoning, now superseded by newer pro models.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI Responses API (and ChatGPT Pro surfaces per metadata). Local metadata lists `opencode/gpt-5.2-pro` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Developer docs list snapshot `gpt-5.2-pro-2025-12-11` and knowledge cutoff August 31, 2025. Announcement URL was unavailable in this pass.
- **IDs:** `gpt-5.2-pro`, `gpt-5.2-pro-2025-12-11`.
- **Context window:** 400,000 context window; 128,000 max output tokens (OpenAI developer docs).
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output (OpenAI developer docs).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $21.00 / 1M input tokens, $168.00 / 1M output tokens (OpenAI developer docs). Cached input pricing not fully extracted in this pass; local metadata notes cached read pricing.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary OpenAI model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

